{"steam_appid":3590290,"steam_name":"DIVE or DIE - Children of Rain","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3590290/1062286844/05ea93489a5cefdb2a78eb88ac8c4df9a8432fc0/1784542786/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1784642424","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257380888/6e401f800bdf8cda2528bf6b108042897f3ebe6e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1784642424","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/8c2e1be0b39c7243c3ae2aad80c39d9fafef6cc0/ss_8c2e1be0b39c7243c3ae2aad80c39d9fafef6cc0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785164308","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/40738f21a7408963c369a873946d5ac180ce61dc/ss_40738f21a7408963c369a873946d5ac180ce61dc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785164308","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/5dd550ccba77933e2c1e50f1fb21d1a4662c29f5/ss_5dd550ccba77933e2c1e50f1fb21d1a4662c29f5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785164308","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/9d23d9b607384209f38572c34a7405d2c697eb39/ss_9d23d9b607384209f38572c34a7405d2c697eb39.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785164308","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/35b3388a8486fe65c7904c391c1d6a92c5c93ace/ss_35b3388a8486fe65c7904c391c1d6a92c5c93ace.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785164308"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/extras/d167ef7ad5e3d85cb76bc27ebac7a8d1.avif?t=1785164308\" width=780 height=304 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Abyssal Pool, an underwater labyrinth of drowned ruins, lost idols, and mutated monsters. Lead a band of desperate survivors with Jack, a haunted man with a singular purpose: to save what's left of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade or fight what lurks in the dark. And try to appease the Maker of Rain before he floods the world in his black tears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/extras/e9c0595bad2fc256f0fa579299aafbfa.poster.avif?t=1785164308\" width=780 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/extras/e9c0595bad2fc256f0fa579299aafbfa.webm?t=1785164308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/extras/e9c0595bad2fc256f0fa579299aafbfa.mp4?t=1785164308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plunge into the cursed Abyssal Pool, where every descent is a deadly gamble. Navigate sunken ruins, face eldritch horrors in darkness, and race against dwindling oxygen. Knowledge and skill are your only guides in the challenging depths.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/extras/c7ed8553f05aa21974ad8d3a02e13870.poster.avif?t=1785164308\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/extras/c7ed8553f05aa21974ad8d3a02e13870.webm?t=1785164308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/extras/c7ed8553f05aa21974ad8d3a02e13870.mp4?t=1785164308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead desperate survivors where death is permanent and sacrifice is inevitable. Manage health and sanity. Decide who joins, who dives, who dies. No One is safe<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/extras/f4a28735e72469f7eb71908278969131.poster.avif?t=1785164308\" width=780 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/extras/f4a28735e72469f7eb71908278969131.webm?t=1785164308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/extras/f4a28735e72469f7eb71908278969131.mp4?t=1785164308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform your fragile camp into humanity's last refuge. Assign vital roles to your survivors, improve their skillset and craft them new tools &amp; equipment. Balance resources against time to upgrade essential structures. A stronger camp means deeper dives and better chances of surviving another day.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/extras/08ad05a256c271f3137d06cb5e7b0eb7.poster.avif?t=1785164308\" width=780 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/extras/08ad05a256c271f3137d06cb5e7b0eb7.webm?t=1785164308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/extras/08ad05a256c271f3137d06cb5e7b0eb7.mp4?t=1785164308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for sacred relics scattered across the drowned world. Find them all before the final Flood drowns everything forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is running out; every day matters. Will you find redemption in the depths, or join the countless souls already claimed by the Black Rain?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590290/extras/f7b6583e3ed45dd69167b944fb4914d7.avif?t=1785164308\" width=780 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 6500 / AMD FX 8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX960 / Radeon R9 380<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 4690 @ 3.5 GHz | AMD Ryzen 5 1600x @ 3.6 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050 / RX VEGA-56<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["Drop Rate Studio"],"publishers":["Dear Villagers"],"release_date":"Jul 21, 2026","metacritic_score":78}